116: - **Readiness and retrieval.** Year 3 assumes the grade 2 rows of Theater, grades K to 2 (last used in grade 2, one
117:   grade back), by course order: theater is not a core course, so a school may not have taught it (lesson 32). Each
118:   year 3 unit therefore opens with a retrieval task inside day 2's opener that carries its ten-minute reteach of the
